---
import config from '../../site.config.json';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title={config.brand.name} chrome={false}>
  <div class="cl-site">
    <header class="cl-header"><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} class="cl-brand"><span>◦</span>{config.brand.name} <small>CLINICAL PRACTICE</small></a><nav aria-label="主要導覽">{config.navigation.filter(x=>x.id!=='booking').map(x=><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL+x.id+'/'}>{x.label}</a>)}</nav><a class="cl-header-cta" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL+'booking/'}>聯絡狀態 ↗</a></header>
    <section class="cl-hero"><div class="cl-hero-copy"><p class="cl-overline">QA 測試網站 / 沒有真實服務</p><h1><span>先讀服務說明，</span><span>再決定下一步。</span></h1><p>先說明服務能協助的範圍、哪些情況需要其他資源，以及初次聯絡後的流程。你可以看完，再決定是否適合。</p><div class="cl-hero-actions"><a href="#scope" class="cl-primary">了解服務範圍 <span>↓</span></a><span>不必先承諾預約。</span></div><div class="cl-meta"><span>服務對象<br /><b>請填入實際範圍</b></span><span>會談方式<br /><b>實體／遠距請核實</b></span><span>資格資訊<br /><b>僅列可驗證資料</b></span></div></div><figure class="cl-room"><img src={import.meta.env.BASE_URL+'illustration.svg'} alt="QA 幾何插畫，不是真實服務場所" /><figcaption>QA 插畫。未提供真實服務場所。</figcaption></figure></section>
    <section class="cl-scope" id="scope"><header><p class="cl-overline">01 / SCOPE & FIT</p><h2>先確認，<br /><i>這是不是合適的支持。</i></h2></header><div class="cl-scope-columns"><article><span>這份測試可供檢查</span><h3>先檢查資訊是否完整</h3><ul><li>想了解可選擇的支持方式</li><li>希望知道流程、費用與界線</li><li>願意先談期待，再決定下一步</li></ul></article><article class="cl-not-fit"><span>可能需要其他資源</span><h3>這個網站不提供緊急協助</h3><ul><li>正處於立即危險或危機情況</li><li>需要此服務範圍以外的醫療支持</li><li>需要即時求助或當地緊急資源</li></ul><p>請聯繫所在地的緊急服務或合適的專業資源。</p></article></div></section>
    <section class="cl-process" id="process"><div class="cl-process-title"><p class="cl-overline">02 / WHAT HAPPENS NEXT</p><h2>合作流程</h2><p>用三個清楚步驟取代模糊的「立即開始」。</p></div><ol><li><details open><summary><span>01</span><h3>一般聯絡</h3><b aria-hidden="true">＋</b></summary><p>QA 範例流程：目前沒有聯絡方式，不提供預約；不收集病歷或敏感資訊。</p></details></li><li><details><summary><span>02</span><h3>初次會談</h3><b aria-hidden="true">＋</b></summary><p>此處僅示意確認適配的步驟；沒有提供會談或療效承諾。</p></details></li><li><details><summary><span>03</span><h3>共同決定</h3><b aria-hidden="true">＋</b></summary><p>需有真實服務者與核實資料，才可以討論實際安排。</p></details></li></ol></section>
    <section class="cl-credentials" id="credentials"><div><p class="cl-overline">03 / VERIFIED INFORMATION</p><h2>可核實的專業背景</h2><p>只列出實際持有、可查證且與服務相關的資格；不放未確認的年資、療效或數據。</p></div><dl><div><dt>資格／執照</dt><dd>請由站長填入可查證資料</dd></div><div><dt>服務地區</dt><dd>請填入實際服務地區與方式</dd></div><div><dt>服務時間</dt><dd>請填入目前可提供的安排</dd></div></dl></section>
    <section class="cl-contact" id="contact"><div><p class="cl-overline">A CLEAR FIRST STEP</p><h2>先問一個<br />一般問題也可以。</h2></div><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL+'booking/'}>查看聯絡設定狀態 ↗</a><p>這是 QA 測試網站，聯絡尚未設定；不接受預約。不要在一般表單收集病歷或敏感健康資料。</p></section>
    <footer class="cl-footer"><span>{config.brand.name} / 專業服務示意</span><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>返回首頁</a></footer>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.cl-site{--cl-ink:#18313a;--cl-blue:#496b78;--cl-paper:#f4f7f5;--cl-line:#cdd8d5;min-height:100vh;background:var(--cl-paper);color:var(--cl-ink);padding:0 clamp(1rem,4vw,4rem) 2rem;font-family:Arial,"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif}.cl-header{height:86px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cl-line);gap:1rem}.cl-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.cl-brand>span{font-size:1.8rem;color:var(--cl-blue)}.cl-brand small{display:block;font: .75rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#4d6063;letter-spacing:.1em}.cl-header nav{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;font-size:.75rem}.cl-header nav a{text-decoration:none}.cl-header-cta,.cl-primary{color:white;background:var(--cl-ink);padding:.7rem 1rem;text-decoration:none;font-size:.7rem;border-radius:2px}.cl-hero{max-width:1260px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:6vw;align-items:center;padding:5rem 0 5.5rem}.cl-overline{font: .75rem ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--cl-blue);text-transform:uppercase}.cl-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,6.8rem);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:.7rem 0 1.2rem}.cl-hero-copy>p:not(.cl-overline){max-width:530px;line-height:1.9;color:#53666b}.cl-hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0 2.3rem}.cl-hero-actions>span{font-size:.75rem;color:#4d5d60}.cl-primary span{margin-left:.8rem}.cl-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--cl-line);padding-top:1rem}.cl-meta span{font-size:.75rem;color:#506467;line-height:1.7}.cl-meta b{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--cl-ink);font-weight:600}.cl-room{margin:0}.cl-room img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:3px}.cl-room figcaption{font-size:.75rem;color:#4e6266;margin-top:.55rem}.cl-scope{max-width:1260px;margin:0 auto 6rem;border-top:1px solid var(--cl-line);padding-top:2rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:5vw}.cl-scope h2,.cl-process h2,.cl-credentials h2,.cl-contact h2{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.7rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.08;margin:.6rem 0}.cl-scope h2 i{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:var(--cl-blue)}.cl-scope-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border:1px solid var(--cl-line)}.cl-scope-columns article{padding:1.5rem}.cl-scope-columns article+article{border-left:1px solid var(--cl-line);background:#eaf0ed}.cl-scope-columns article>span{font: .75rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--cl-blue)}.cl-scope-columns h3{font-size:1rem}.cl-scope-columns ul{padding-left:1.1rem;font-size:.78rem;line-height:2}.cl-scope-columns p{font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4d5d60}.cl-process{max-width:1260px;margin:0 auto 6rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:7vw;background:#e7eeeb;padding:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,3rem)}.cl-process-title>p:last-child{font-size:.78rem;color:#4d5d60;line-height:1.7}.cl-process ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.cl-process li{display:block;padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #bfcfca}.cl-process li>details>summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:50px 1fr 24px;gap:1rem;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.cl-process li>details>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.cl-process li>details>summary::marker{content:""}.cl-process li>details>summary>span{font: .7rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--cl-blue)}.cl-process h3{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem}.cl-process li>details>summary>b{font-weight:400;color:var(--cl-blue);transition:transform .2s}.cl-process li details[open]>summary>b{transform:rotate(45deg)}.cl-process li p{margin:.6rem 0 0 66px;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.7;color:#435c60}.cl-credentials{max-width:1260px;margin:0 auto 6rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6vw}.cl-credentials>div>p:last-child{max-width:480px;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.8;color:#4c5d60}.cl-credentials dl{margin:0}.cl-credentials dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;padding:.9rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--cl-line);font-size:.76rem}.cl-credentials dt{color:#4d5f62}.cl-credentials dd{margin:0}.cl-contact{max-width:1260px;margin:0 auto 2rem;background:var(--cl-ink);color:white;padding:2.5rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:1rem}.cl-contact .cl-overline{color:#a6c7c3}.cl-contact h2{margin:.3rem 0;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem)}.cl-contact>a{color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #a6c7c3;text-decoration:none;padding-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.78rem}.cl-contact>p:last-child{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.7;color:#c3d3d1;margin:0}.cl-footer{max-width:1260px;margin:auto;border-top:1px solid var(--cl-line);padding:1rem 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font: .75rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#4c6063}.cl-footer a{color:var(--cl-blue)}@media(max-width:850px){.cl-header{height:auto;padding:1rem 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.cl-header nav{order:3;width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.cl-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.cl-room{max-width:700px;margin-left:auto;width:80%}.cl-scope,.cl-process,.cl-credentials{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}}@media(max-width:560px){.cl-header nav{font-size:.75rem;gap:.45rem}.cl-header-cta{font-size:.75rem;padding:.6rem}.cl-hero{padding:3rem 0}.cl-hero h1{font-size:14vw}.cl-room{width:100%}.cl-meta{gap:.45rem}.cl-meta span{font-size:.75rem}.cl-scope-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cl-scope-columns article+article{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--cl-line)}.cl-contact{padding:1.2rem;grid-template-columns:1fr}.cl-contact>p:last-child{grid-column:auto}.cl-footer{flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}}

.cl-header nav{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0 .5rem;font-size:.875rem}.cl-header nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:.5rem}.cl-hero h1 span{display:inline-block;max-width:100%;text-wrap:balance}.cl-hero h1{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.cl-header{height:auto;min-height:92px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:1rem 0}
.cl-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,6rem)}.cl-hero h1 span{display:block}.cl-header nav{margin-left:auto}.cl-meta b{font-size:.875rem}.cl-hero-actions>span{font-size:.875rem}.cl-process summary{min-height:44px}.cl-scope-columns ul,.cl-scope-columns p,.cl-process li p,.cl-credentials>div>p:last-child{font-size:1rem}.cl-contact>p:last-child{font-size:.875rem}@media(max-width:850px){.cl-header nav{margin-left:0;justify-content:flex-start;width:100%}}@media(max-width:560px){.cl-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,10vw,3.5rem)}.cl-meta{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.cl-hero-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>